{"pin":"BH10992","subcodes":[{"code":"BH10992","anchor":"","first_line":"My God, my Provider, my Beloved, my Desire! Unto Thee have I come, imploring from Thee that which is conducive to Thy grace.","first_line_orig":"الها پروردگارا محبوبا مقصودا بتو آمده ام و از تو میطلبم آنچه را که سبب بخشش تو است توئی بحر جود و مالک  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"50","translations":[{"language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA30:100b","source":"INBA30","locator":"100b","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v030/?page=54"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA65:059","source":"INBA65","locator":"059","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v065/?page=61"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AHM.351","source":"AHM","locator":"351","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/AHM/ahm-351.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.164","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"164","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-166.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"DWNP_v6#05 p.001a","source":"DWNP_v6","locator":"05 p.001a","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/the-dawn-vol-6-burma-1928"},{"kind":"translation","code":"ADMS#075","source":"ADMS","locator":"075","url":"https://adibmasumian.com/translations/bahaullah-prayer-ahm-351/"}]}]}
